      <title>前Rockstar开发者称实体游戏光盘早该退场 削减成本是主要理由</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/game/post/20260912/%E5%89%8DRockstar%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E7%A7%B0%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%85%89%E7%9B%98%E6%97%A9%E8%AF%A5%E9%80%80%E5%9C%BA-%E5%89%8A%E5%87%8F%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1/</link>
